# Factor Analysis and Counseling Research

**Authors:** Weiss, David J.

## Abstract
Topics discussed include factor analysis versus cluster analysis, analysis of Q correlation matrices, ipsativity and factor analysis, and tests for the significance of a correlation matrix prior to application of factor analytic techniques. Techniques for factor extraction discussed include principal components, canonical factor analysis, alpha factor analysis, principal factors and image factor analysis, and multimethod factor analysis. (Author)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ026017

